From: NWA50BE OpenWrt Project <noreply@invalid.example>
Subject: [PATCH] qca-nss-phy: ignore empty package probe
SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause

OpenWrt's rootfs assembly sources the init helper without an argument. Do not
fall through to its undefined fatal helper for that packaging probe. Runtime
load behavior and diagnostics for nonempty unknown arguments remain unchanged.

--- a/feeds/qca-wifi-7/qca-nss-phy/files/qca-nss-phy.init
+++ b/feeds/qca-wifi-7/qca-nss-phy/files/qca-nss-phy.init
@@ -20,6 +20,8 @@ case "$1" in
 	load)
 		load
 		;;
+	'')
+		;;
 	*)
 		fatal "Parameter $1 unknown"
 		;;
